:: Forced Diaper Dad [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:LightCoral">You feel your body fighting desperately as time begins to run out and the dam begins to leak and give way. You turn and look in the direction of your family’s bathroom, so close yet so far, but cannot take another step before the warm humiliating liquid begins to escape and run down your leg. Your body shivers, your eyes water, and you feel a level of disappointment grow within yourself that only grows worse when you hear a familiar voice call out. <br>

