<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“All cleaned up. I’ll toss these in the wash. Are you done in there?”</span> He asks. You nod and turn off the water, stepping out and drying off the parts you washed, though feel a little awkward with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> standing there watching. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, so I got you something to wear. They’re pretty old from when <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> was still having accidents, guess I kept them just in case. I know you may not like it, but I think it would be best if-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">pauses, holding up a diaper! <br>
<br>
He can’t seriously mean for you to put that on at your age! Wasn’t having an accident humiliating enough!?</span> <br>
